**Not implemented / simplified from the spec:**

- **Second captive:** only one fighter can be held at a time (arcade allows a boss to capture a second ship while one is already held); a second tractor attempt is suppressed while a captive is held.
- **Dual fighter vs. tractor beam:** a dual fighter is immune to capture (arcade behaviour for catching one half of a dual pair is not reproduced).
- **Escort pairing** is same-type (bosses take Goei escorts); the arcade's mixed bee/butterfly escort pairs are not exactly replicated. Dive escort scoring tiers (400/800/1600) work as specified.
- Entry/challenge flight paths are original bezier curves inspired by the arcade loops, not the exact original path data.
- Formation firing happens both in formation and while entering (spec only required "may fire while entering"); a single shared fire timer is used.
- Enemy bullets are aimed straight at the player rather than using the arcade's angle-quantized shots.
